  "description": {
    "raw": "The target’s buoyancy becomes and stays swiftly rising, regardless of how dense the target and its gear are. Among other effects, the target needs to succeed at a DC 20 Swim check to submerge itself and to stay submerged (see Buoyancy on page 43).",
